WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,310 --> 00:00:07,400
Zixuan, do you want to do it?

2
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:11,360
Chen Qi, do you want to commit suicide?

3
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:17,370
Let go and die, you still dare to look at me like this

4
00:00:17,370 --> 00:00:30,830
Senior Brother, have you given up and waited for death?

5
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:32,830
You are all wrong because of my cultivation.

6
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:33,830
But I don’t believe it

7
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:35,830
Since cultivating immortality requires faith

8
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:38,830
There is no right or wrong in the world. This road has not been taken.

9
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:39,830
I'll just step out

10
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:44,940
He entered a road no one had ever walked before

11
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:48,640
Desperate for ever

12
00:00:48,640 --> 00:01:14,570
You guys are laughing

13
00:01:14,570 --> 00:01:17,570
I'll kill all the unboxing soldiers at halftime for you.

14
00:01:17,570 --> 00:01:21,350
Saved the wariness

15
00:01:21,350 --> 00:01:23,480
Why should I be suppressed by you?

16
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:32,800
You are a young cultivator

17
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:34,800
God's hand has turned into this ghost shape
